them something like "stupid."  This is a stopgap measure to keep
me from kicking them to death when I'm really annoyed.

When I'm feeling really bawdy, I name my cat Pussy.  (^&  (then
i usually get really creative with the fruit option and naming
juices, too.  Here's hoping someone got a good laugh out
of my bones level).  "This tastes like schlongus juice!  Call
